id: K8S-034
title: Service without selector
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: kind: Service
patterns:
  - regex: selector:
    message: "Service without selector — no pods will receive traffic"
fix: Add a selector that matches your pod labels, or use an ExternalName/headless service if intentional.
